  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.76pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(304.56pt, 288.72pt, "Fig. 5. Schematic of the proposed rectifier. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.755pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(314.4pt, 311.16pt, "The rectifying diode is a Schottky diode SMS 7630, from ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 322.979pt, "Skyworks Solutions, Inc.. According to the datasheet of the ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 334.679pt, "SMS 7630, its forward turn-on voltage and reverse breakdown ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 346.439pt, "voltage are ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.755pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(349.62pt, 346.439pt, "V")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 6.302pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(355.56pt, 347.4pt, "bi")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.755pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(360.48pt, 346.44pt, " = 0.34 V and ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.755pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(415.26pt, 346.44pt, "V")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 6.302pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(421.26pt, 347.4pt, "br")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.755pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(426.84pt, 346.44pt, " = 2 V, respectively. As derived ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 358.139pt, "from Equation (12), when the diode SMS 7630 achieves its ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 369.959pt, "optimal conversion efficiency, the output dc voltage is ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 381.659pt, "approximately 0.8 V. The voltage-controlled switch in the ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 393.358pt, "proposed rectifier is two PIN diodes SMP 1345 (the conduction ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 405.118pt, "voltage of a single PIN diode is 0.89V, which will affect the ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 416.879pt, "maximum efficiency of the rectifier), from Skyworks. They are ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 428.639pt, "widely used in RF circuits.  ")
  #line-at(314.4pt, 440.338pt, "According to the input power, the rectifier can be divided ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 452.098pt, "into two operating modes. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.744pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(314.4pt, 463.8pt, "Mode 1: ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.755pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(351.18pt, 463.8pt, "When the input power is low, the dc voltage output ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 475.619pt, "by the rectifying diode is low, and the PIN diode remains off. ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 487.319pt, "At this time, the microstrip line in series with the PIN diode is ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 499.079pt, "in ")
  #line-at(323.643pt, 499.079pt, "an ")
  #line-at(344.282pt, 499.079pt, "open-circuit ")
  #line-at(402.783pt, 499.079pt, "state. ")
  #line-at(434.581pt, 499.079pt, "The ")
  #line-at(461.232pt, 499.079pt, "rectifier ")
  #line-at(503.456pt, 499.079pt, "is ")
  #line-at(521.396pt, 499.079pt, "in ")
  #line-at(540.473pt, 499.079pt, "an ")
  #line-at(304.56pt, 510.779pt, "impedance-matched state and operates efficiently. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.744pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(314.4pt, 522.6pt, "Mode 2: ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.755pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(351.96pt, 522.6pt, "When the input power is high, the rectifying diode ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 534.299pt, "outputs a higher voltage, causing the PIN diode to turn on. At ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 546.059pt, "this point, the microstrip line in series with the PIN diode ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 557.759pt, "transitions from an open-circuit state to a short-circuit state. ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 569.519pt, "This results in impedance mismatch in the rectifier, increasing ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 581.279pt, "reflection and reducing the power entering the rectifying diode, ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 592.979pt, "thereby protecting the rectifying diode from receiving ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 604.739pt, "excessive power. Additionally, the PIN diode limits the ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 616.439pt, "maximum output dc voltage—specifically, the output voltage ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 628.258pt, "cannot exceed the PIN diode's turn-on voltage. This effectively ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 639.958pt, "protects the rectifying diode from reverse breakdown under ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 651.718pt, "high-power conditions. ")
  #line-at(350.46pt, 675.119pt, "IV.")
  #line-at(370.2pt, 675.12pt, "S")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.76pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(375.6pt, 675.12pt, "IMULATION")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.755pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(419.58pt, 675.12pt, ",")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.76pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(422.04pt, 675.12pt, " AND ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.755pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(442.74pt, 675.12pt, "M")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.76pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(451.44pt, 675.12pt, "EASUREMENT ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.755pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(314.4pt, 690.24pt, "To verify the proposed reconfigurable strategy for the ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 701.939pt, "low-power rectifier, we fabricated the proposed rectifier ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 713.699pt, "operating at 2.45 GHz. Its layout and the photograph are shown ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 725.399pt, "in Fig. 6(a). The rectifier is optimized around 0 dBm, and the ")
  #line-at(304.559pt, 737.159pt, "measured |")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.755pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(346.799pt, 737.159pt, "S")
